Aspirational design sketch: scope composition (scope(other)), globs (users:*),
conditional registration ([debug]debug:*), and the ~[registry:scope(name)]
annotation form. None of that surface exists. Keep as the written design or
retire when the registry design is ruled.

Two things it no longer waits on (fixed 2026-08-07): its interpreter source
carried `~` on every invocation and it passed an invented `file_name` to
parse.source. Both are gone — parse.source now takes no file name and goes
through the interpreter's own flow_parser, so the `~` it used to require is
refused here exactly as it is on `run`.
